{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d59aa3231457187f","name":"Inexpugnable-Class Tactical Command Vessel","source":{"id":"source:reference-d59aa3231457187f","title":"Inexpugnable-Class Tactical Command Vessel","revision":19178,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:28:08Z","sha256":"2a6a1238ca77d148d653ee9b671482dbedc6d51ccc1a035ac1b9a56b783966ac","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19178","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Inexpugnable-Class%20Tactical%20Command%20Vessel&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d59aa3231457187f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Known to the crews as the \"Inexies,\" ",{"tag":"i","children":["Inexpugnable"]},"-Class Tactical Command Vessels are designed to serve as important pieces of a larger tactical puzzle. With dozens of the Rendili ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Hammerhead"]},"-Class Cruisers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hammerhead-Class_Cruisers"}," protecting the same lines during the run-up to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorian Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Wars"},", fire-control coordination is a key concern. Enter the Vanjervalis Systems computer conglomerate, which proposes a colossal computer to be fitted to a Rendili warship frame. Using the native software codes in a ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Hammerhead"]},"-Class Cruiser"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hammerhead-Class_Cruiser","referenceId":"reference:9444247e14771bd9"},", a single ",{"tag":"i","children":["Inexpugnable"]},"-Class Tactical Command Vessel can transmit commands instantaneously and simultaneously to as many as 64 ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Hammerhead"]},"-Class Cruisers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hammerhead-Class_Cruisers"},", managing their combat systems from a single headquarters.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As much flying ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Stations"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Stations","referenceId":"reference:65763f09c9074f45"}," as warships, the 3,100-meter-diameter ",{"tag":"i","children":["Inexpugnable"]},"-Class Tactical Command Vessels moves slowly, safely defended by the dozens of cruisers in the vicinity. Helmsmen refer to the peculiar bridge configuration as the \"wishing well\" because it merges visual and electronic data by suspending holographic images over a transparent deck.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Adapting the proof-of-concept ",{"tag":"i","children":["Swiftsure"]},", the Republic produced less than half a dozen prototypes before ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorians","referenceId":"reference:b7f4f8a44de3a6c8"}," attacked in force. One, ",{"tag":"i","children":["Courageous"]},", is helmed by then-Captain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Saul Karath"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Saul_Karath","referenceId":"reference:71c4ad7788fc4d79"}," at the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vanquo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vanquo?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Even though he loses The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Courageous"]}," in the escape from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Serroco"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Serroco?action=edit&redlink=1"},", he helps Randili/Vanjervalis incorporate the knowledge gained into the refit of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Swiftsure"]},", his next command, which would become the template for the entire production model.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":